<section id="cli-reference">
<h1>CLI reference <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#cli-reference" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h1>
<section id="commands">
<h2>Commands <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#commands" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>
<dl class="lsd-definition-list">
<dt>lsdocs build</dt>
<dd>Builds the site.</dd>
<dt>lsdocs init</dt>
<dd>Starts a new site.</dd>
</dl>
<section id="lsdocs-build">
<h3><code>lsdocs build</code> <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#lsdocs-build" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>
<p>Builds the site. Use <code>--trace-rpc</code> to see every plugin message.</p>
</section>
<section id="lsdocs-init">
<h3><code>lsdocs init</code> <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#lsdocs-init" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>
<p>Creates <code>lsdocs.toml</code> and <code>docs/index.md</code>.
Line one,<br>
line two after a hard break.</p>
<hr>
<p>See the <a href="../guide/configuration.html#options">configuration guide</a>.</p>
</section>
</section>
